OL,3,GNEWSAAI teddy for three-year-olds makes
OL,4,Aunprompted 'I can't help with killing
OL,5,Ayou' remark
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn AI teddy marketed as being "perfect"
OL,8,Ffor children as young as three said "I
OL,9,Fcan't help with killing you" after
OL,10,Fseemingly mishearing a question.
OL,12,FIt came amid a BBC investigation into
OL,13,FAI toys and it made the unprompted
OL,14,Fremark while being asked how babies are
OL,15,Fmade.
OL,17,FAI toy company founder Paul Clarke said
OL,18,Fthe industry was "crying out" for
OL,19,Fregulation - a call echoed by the
OL,20,Fchildren's commissioner for Wales.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
