OL,3,GNEWSAAI teddy for three-year-olds makes
OL,4,Aunprompted 'I can't help with killing
OL,5,Ayou' remark
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government said children's
OL,8,Fsafety would always be a top priority
OL,9,Fand it supported innovation while
OL,10,Fensuring products were safe.
